OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSARower delighted after
OL,4,Achampionships' 'declare as British to
OL,5,Acompete' U-turn
OL,6,
OL,7,FCollins said he has now received an
OL,8,Fapology from British Rowing and been
OL,9,Ftold that due to his citizenship
OL,10,Fstatus, he is eligible to appear in
OL,11,Fboth the British and World rankings.
OL,13,FBBC News NI has contacted British
OL,14,FRowing for a response.
